---
const title = 'USIVA Route Atlas | Find the Right Page';
const description = 'A clear route atlas for USIVA: choose planning, context, scope, field notes, questions, media, or the connected US Fellows pathway.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/other-pages.html';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://usiva.org/assets/usiva-social.svg" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="USIVA — visa-readiness and compliance planning" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#c49a4f" />
  </head>
  <body class="atlas-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header"><div class="atlas-wrap header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="USIVA home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">US</span><span><strong>USIVA</strong><small>Route atlas / start here</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/services.html">Services</a><a href="/about.html">About</a><a href="/pricing.html">Scope &amp; fees</a><a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a><a class="nav-cta" href="/contacts.html">Start a question</a></nav></div></header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="atlas-hero"><div class="atlas-wrap atlas-hero__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">USIVA / route atlas</p><h1>A small site should still tell you where to go next.</h1><p class="hero-lede">Use this index as a decision map, not a wall of links. Start with the question in front of you, then move to the page that can help you frame it.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button--ink" href="#atlas">Browse the routes</a><a class="under-link" href="/contacts.html">Prepare a question →</a></div></div><div class="atlas-compass" aria-hidden="true"><span class="compass-north">ASK</span><span class="compass-east">VERIFY</span><span class="compass-south">HAND OFF</span><span class="compass-west">READ</span><b></b></div></div></section>

      <section class="section" id="atlas" aria-labelledby="atlas-heading"><div class="atlas-wrap"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">The index</p><h2 id="atlas-heading">Choose by reader job.</h2><p>Every route has a different job. If the answer depends on personal facts, stop at orientation and use the contact brief to prepare a verified handoff.</p></div><div class="route-atlas">
        <a href="/services.html" class="atlas-row atlas-row--feature"><span class="atlas-code">01</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>Services</strong><small>Organize a readiness file, pathway map, authorization question, or source trail.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I need a plan</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a href="/about.html" class="atlas-row"><span class="atlas-code">02</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>About</strong><small>Understand the USIVA / US Council / US Fellows relationship and its boundaries.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I need context</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a href="/pricing.html" class="atlas-row"><span class="atlas-code">03</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>Scope &amp; fees</strong><small>Read the plain-language fee posture: no public price list and no payment request here.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I need scope</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a href="/blog.html" class="atlas-row"><span class="atlas-code">04</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>Field notes</strong><small>Follow question-led reading paths about preparation, boundaries, and source discipline.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I need orientation</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a href="/tips-faq.html" class="atlas-row"><span class="atlas-code">05</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>Tips &amp; FAQ</strong><small>Check common planning questions, verify-before-you-act prompts, and source links.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I have a quick question</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a href="/contacts.html" class="atlas-row"><span class="atlas-code">06</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>Contacts</strong><small>Prepare a concise handoff and choose the public route that matches your purpose.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I need a next action</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a href="/media-gallery.html" class="atlas-row"><span class="atlas-code">07</span><span class="atlas-name"><strong>Media &amp; field notes</strong><small>Inspect visual planning artifacts for files, pathways, boundaries, and source trails.</small></span><span class="atlas-job">I learn visually</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
      </div></div></section>

      <section class="starting-points" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><div class="atlas-wrap"><div class="section-head section-head--light"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Three starting points</p><h2 id="start-heading">If you are not sure, begin with the sentence that sounds most like you.</h2></div><div class="starting-grid"><a href="/tips-faq.html" class="starting-card"><span>“I am still learning.”</span><strong>Read the basics</strong><small>Use Tips &amp; FAQ to name the first question without making a personal conclusion.</small></a><a href="/services.html" class="starting-card starting-card--gold"><span>“I am preparing.”</span><strong>Build the file</strong><small>Use Services to sort records, timing, authorization, and the next authority to ask.</small></a><a href="/contacts.html" class="starting-card starting-card--red"><span>“I need to hand this off.”</span><strong>Write the brief</strong><small>Use Contacts to keep the first message concise and protect sensitive information.</small></a></div></div></section>

      <section class="external-path" aria-labelledby="external-heading"><div class="atlas-wrap external-path__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A connected path</p><h2 id="external-heading">USIVA is not the whole research pathway.</h2><p>For the International R&amp;D Scholars Program and its research-pathway context, continue to the US Fellows public site.</p></div><a class="button button--red" href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html">View US Fellows ↗</a></div></section>

      <section class="notice"><div class="atlas-wrap"><strong>Important notice:</strong> This atlas is informational navigation. USIVA content does not replace individualized legal advice or guarantee admission, employment, funding, visa issuance, or government approval.</div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="atlas-wrap footer-grid"><div><a class="footer-brand" href="/">USIVA</a><p>Visa-readiness and compliance planning for international study and research pathways.</p></div><div><p class="footer-label">Route atlas</p><a href="/services.html">Services</a><a href="/about.html">About</a><a href="/pricing.html">Scope &amp; fees</a></div><div><p class="footer-label">Read</p><a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a><a href="/tips-faq.html">Tips &amp; FAQ</a><a href="/media-gallery.html">Media &amp; field notes</a></div><div><p class="footer-label">Act</p><a href="/contacts.html">Start a question</a><a href="https://usfellows.org/apply.html">US Fellows apply ↗</a><p>Verify current instructions with the authority responsible for your situation.</p></div></div><div class="atlas-wrap footer-bottom">© 2026 USIVA · A US Council companion site.</div></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #fbfaf7; color: #172231; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  :global(a:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #d0a85c; outline-offset: 4px; }
  :global(p) { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #5c6974; }
  :global(h1), :global(h2), :global(h3) { margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: #0a253f; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.08; }
  :global(h1) { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.2vw, 7rem); letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  :global(h2) { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 4.3rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .atlas-wrap { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: -4rem; left: 1rem; z-index: 20; padding: .7rem 1rem; background: #fff; color: #0a253f; font-weight: 800; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; }
  .site-header { background: #fbfaf7; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dfe1; }
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; min-height: 5.6rem; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; }
  .brand-mark { display: grid; width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #b9893e; border-radius: 50%; color: #0a253f; font: 700 .8rem Georgia, serif; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #fbfaf7, inset 0 0 0 5px #b9893e; }
  .brand strong { display: block; color: #0a253f; font: 700 1.5rem/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .brand small { display: block; color: #52616a; font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: .3rem 1.25rem; color: #334350; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 750; }
  nav a:hover { color: #ae403a; }
  .nav-cta { padding: .55rem .8rem; border: 1px solid #ae403a; color: #ae403a; }
  .atlas-hero { background: #f2ede4; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd4c7; }
  .atlas-hero__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(15rem, .8fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 9rem); align-items: center; min-height: 39rem; padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem) clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .atlas-hero__grid > div:first-child { max-width: 57rem; }
  .eyebrow, .footer-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ae403a; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eyebrow--light { color: #efd69b; }
  .hero-lede { max-width: 46rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #40515b; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); line-height: 1.5; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 3rem; padding: .75rem 1.05rem; border: 1px solid #0a253f; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .button--ink { background: #0a253f; color: #fff; }
  .button--red { background: #ae403a; border-color: #ae403a; color: #fff; }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .under-link { color: #ae403a; font-size: .87rem; font-weight: 850; }
  .atlas-compass { position: relative; width: min(21rem, 75vw); aspect-ratio: 1; margin-inline: auto; border: 1px solid #b9893e; border-radius: 50%; color: #0a253f; transform: rotate(-9deg); }
  .atlas-compass::before, .atlas-compass::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 12%; border: 1px solid #cbbd9f; border-radius: 50%; }
  .atlas-compass::after { inset: 25%; border-color: #ae403a; }
  .atlas-compass b { position: absolute; inset: 19%; margin: auto; width: 42%; height: 42%; border: 1px solid #0a253f; background: #c49a4f; transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .atlas-compass b::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 22%; border: 1px solid #0a253f; background: #f2ede4; }
  .atlas-compass span { position: absolute; z-index: 1; font: 700 .65rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .compass-north { top: 6%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .compass-east { top: 50%; right: 2%; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  .compass-south { bottom: 6%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .compass-west { top: 50%; left: 2%; transform: translateY(-50%); }
  .section { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); }
  .section-head { max-width: 55rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .section-head > p:last-child { max-width: 45rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .route-atlas { border-top: 1px solid #c4ced0; }
  .atlas-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(9rem, .38fr) 2rem; gap: 1.2rem; align-items: start; padding: 1.2rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #c4ced0; }
  .atlas-row:hover { background: #f2ede4; transform: translateX(.25rem); }
  .atlas-row--feature { padding-block: 1.5rem; background: #e0ece7; }
  .atlas-code { color: #ae403a; font: 700 .78rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .atlas-name strong { display: block; color: #0a253f; font: 600 1.55rem Georgia, serif; }
  .atlas-name small { display: block; margin-top: .25rem; color: #5b6972; font-size: .9rem; }
  .atlas-job { color: #52616a; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .atlas-row > b { color: #ae403a; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .starting-points { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem); background: #071827; }
  .section-head--light h2 { color: #fff; }
  .starting-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.22); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); }
  .starting-card { min-height: 19rem; padding: 1.7rem; background: #123957; color: #fff; }
  .starting-card--gold { background: #c49a4f; color: #0a253f; }
  .starting-card--red { background: #ae403a; }
  .starting-card span { display: block; margin-bottom: 4rem; color: #fff1b8; font: 600 1.1rem Georgia, serif; }
  .starting-card--gold span { color: #0a253f; }
  .starting-card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .4rem; font: 600 1.8rem Georgia, serif; }
  .starting-card small { display: block; color: #e8f2f3; font-size: .9rem; }
  .starting-card--gold small { color: #172f3c; }
  .external-path { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem); background: #e2eeea; }
  .external-path__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 2rem; align-items: end; }
  .external-path__grid > div { max-width: 46rem; }
  .external-path__grid p:last-child { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .notice { padding-block: 1.2rem; background: #f8e7be; color: #36280e; font-size: .88rem; }
  .site-footer { padding-block: 4rem 1.5rem; background: #0b2238; color: #cad7df; }
  .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .7fr .8fr 1.1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .footer-brand { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: .8rem; color: #fff; font: 700 1.55rem Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .site-footer p { color: #b5c5cf; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a { display: block; margin: .35rem 0; color: #d9e4e9; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a:hover { color: #f0d798; }
  .footer-label { margin-bottom: .7rem; color: #efd69b; }
  .footer-bottom { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); color: #8ea3b0; font-size: .78rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding-block: 1rem; }
    nav { justify-content: flex-start; }
    .atlas-hero__grid, .external-path__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .atlas-compass { margin-inline: 0; width: min(18rem, 68vw); }
    .starting-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .starting-card--red { grid-column: span 2; }
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .atlas-wrap { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1160px); }
    .atlas-row { grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr 1.3rem; gap: .7rem; padding-inline: .5rem; }
    .atlas-job { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; }
    .atlas-row > b { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; }
    .starting-grid, .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .starting-card--red { grid-column: auto; }
    .starting-card { min-height: auto; }
    .starting-card span { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .actions .button { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; } .button:hover, .atlas-row:hover { transform: none; } }
</style>
